@label practice_scene
[show lavender right talking]
Lavender: Practice setup for Diagnostics, regression tests, and ship readiness.
Lavender: We'll run a tiny branch so you can inspect flow behavior quickly.
> Practice path A -> practice_a
> Practice path B -> practice_b
> Practice path C -> practice_c

@label practice_a
[show lavender left talking]
Lavender: Practice A uses the core pattern: VNS Diagnostics.
narrator: Validate state transitions after each command batch.
[set practice_result 1]
[jump practice_wrap]

@label practice_b
[show lavender center talking]
Lavender: Practice B uses alternate pattern: parser validation.
narrator: Compare readability between A and B.
[set practice_result 2]
[jump practice_wrap]

@label practice_c
[show lavender right talking]
Lavender: Practice C uses stress pattern: release checklist.
narrator: Check if this remains maintainable after content scale-up.
[set practice_result 3]
[jump practice_wrap]

@label practice_wrap
[if practice_result == 1]
Lavender: You picked A. Good for stable baseline implementation.
[elif practice_result == 2]
Lavender: You picked B. Useful when balancing readability and flexibility.
[else]
Lavender: You picked C. Great for stress-testing workflow assumptions.
[endif]
Lavender: Practice scene complete.
> Back to lesson menu -> lesson_menu

@label return_hub
